{"id":"vod_hh_26338","vodId":"26338","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠GT","name_cn":"龙珠GT","date":"1996-01-01","year":"1996","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第65集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/2fe19a9f65a57f9717e619f339217837.jpg"},"summary":"许多年过去，地球在Z战士的保卫下日渐和平与繁荣。某天，皮拉夫大王和他的爪牙历经千辛万苦来到神殿，找到了神仙与比克大魔王分身前制造的黑星龙珠。由于孙悟空的突然出现，皮拉夫慌忙之中许下让孙悟空变成少年模样的愿望。在此之后，黑星龙珠散落到宇宙各个角落，如果在一年之内无法找到七颗黑星龙珠的话，地球将会爆炸毁灭。情况危急，小悟空和孙女小芳开始了一段惊险刺激的宇宙大冒险。超级17号、邪恶龙等强大的对手接连出现，悟空面临更大的挑战……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 16:57:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":65,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe03p9Nd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepVKRQb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8YA9rd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penJXY5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4Kw9Ja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVZr5ze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6Vy0Nb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejJMn4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2Jr9Ab/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejJMnye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel6Lp1b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDErY6d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yer752Wa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepVKkmb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penJXRPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVZrvOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6VyWzb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2Jr7Wb